  "text": "1\nCommunity\nClassroom\nCalendar\nMembers\nMap\nLeaderboards\nAbout\nChase AI Community\n1\n5\nVitalii Hryhorenko\n5d • ⚡General discussion\n🚨 AI Influencer Challenge 🚨\nI’ve put together 3 influencer images below, but there’s a twist…\n1 of them is fully AI-generated and already has 200K+ followers.\nMost people won’t spot it at first glance — you’ll need a real eagle eye to figure out which one is the AI.\nTake your best guess before looking too hard 👀\nComment the number you think it is, and I’ll reveal the answer after.\nMy guess is most people will get this wrong\nCan you spot the AI influencer?\nLike\n4\n8 comments\n1\nAndrew Cebulka\n• 5d\nskyline is crazy artifacted.\n0\nReply\n1\nBronson Lance\n• 5d\nIll guess 3\n0\nReply\n1\nBrian Clarke\n• 5d\nI'd say them all. But the blonde one looks the most AI to me.\n0\nReply\n3\nMichaela Anderson\n• 5d\nThis is actually harder than I expected gonna go with #2 but I’m probably overthinking it.\n0\nReply\n2\nStefan Bernius\n• 4d\nwhere can i find AI influencer with an established followerbase\n0\nReply\n1\nEdward Arcuri\n• 4d\nThe blonde. How many fricken churches did you tell it to add?\n0\nReply\n2\nJoseph C\n• 4d (edited)\n3\n0\nReply\n1\nJohn Lohman\n• 3d\n1\n0\nReply\n1\n\n\n\n\n5\n🚨 AI Influencer Challenge 🚨\nChase AI Community\nskool.com/chase-ai-community\nGo from learning to earning. Join Chase AI+👇\nUpgrade to Chase AI+\n57.5k\nMembers\n239\nOnline\n3\nAdmins\nINVITE PEOPLE\nLeaderboard (30-day)\n1\nVitalii Hryhorenko\n+51\n2\nCharles Dove\n🔥\n+23\n3\nCyber Ai\n+22\n4\nSam Alder\n🔥\n+16\n5\nJonathan Wilson\n+15\nSee all leaderboards\nPowered by",
